    "created_at": "2022-05-04T09:30:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-04T09:30:07Z",
    "body": "Apologies for dropping the ball here. The Public Suffix List (I assume you meant to write that) is a list of public suffixes, informally speaking. When that list is processed for practical usage, the U-labels will have been converted to ASCII, which is what the URL Standard is asserting.\r\n\r\nI don't think there's any problem here so closing this, but do let me know if I got it wrong somehow and there is a problem.",
